//! Riot's own art, bound into the binary: agent portraits, killfeed crops,
//! player cards, map strips and rank emblems.
//!
//! Generated by hand from valorant-api.com, which mirrors Riot's assets, and
//! committed. Nothing in this app goes online: these change when Riot ships an
//! agent or a map, a few times a year, and that is a decision somebody takes
//! rather than something a build does behind their back.
//!
//! Keyed by the name the backend sends, lowercased with everything that is not
//! a letter or a digit removed, so `KAY/O` and `kayo` are the same agent.

